Download a model

Usage: wally models pull [OPTIONS] model

Arguments:
  model                       Model id, alias, hf.co/org/repo/file or URL

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
      --engine TEXT           Engine to fetch for (mlx, llamacpp, onnx, sherpa)

Examples:
  wally models pull qwen3-0.6b                  From the catalog
  wally models pull hf.co/<org>/<repo>/<file>   From Hugging Face
